  "summary": "若某下标 i 到至少一个值为 key 的下标 j 的距离不超过 k，则 i 为 K 近邻下标，按升序返回全部。",
  "insight": "每个 key 位置覆盖闭区间 [j-k,j+k]。用布尔数组标记这些区间，再顺序收集即可；约束允许直接覆盖。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "距离条件包含等于 k",
    "答案下标不可重复",
    "范围裁剪到数组边界"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "mark-key-centered-intervals",
      "title": "标记 Key 中心区间",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "合并语义通过布尔标记自然去重。",
      "steps": [
        "nearby[n]=false",
        "遇 nums[j]==key，遍历 max(0,j-k)..min(n-1,j+k) 标真",
        "顺序收集所有 true 下标"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(nk)",
        "space": "O(n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/mark-key-centered-intervals/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/mark-key-centered-intervals/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/mark-key-centered-intervals/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
